{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "32", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Earlier in the day, Chandimal, Mathews and Mendis helped Sri Lanka post a respectable total although the tourists slipped in the back end of their innings. Even though the total looked below par, SL may well have made a match out of it. In the end, it was the weather that had the final say. The scoreline remains 1-0 in favour of the hosts with two matches remaining in the series. The next ODI will be held on 29th June at The Oval. The action starts at 1730 IST. Until then, it's goodbye from us!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "31", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Chasing a moderate target of 249, England were off to a shaky beginning. Roy and Hales opened for the home side, but the latter was dispatched for a duck in the first three balls itself. With the opening pair broken, Roy and Root faced 21 balls, scoring 15 runs. Their innings lasted for only four overs until the persistent drizzle forced the umpires to bring the covers back on. Initially, there was still some hope for a resumption, but the pitch finally got too soaked for play to resume.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "30", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "2200 IST Update - Unfortunately, the expected news is out. MATCH HAS BEEN ABANDONED. A pity really as we could have had a good contest, especially with the early wicket fall.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "29", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Oh no! The rain is back and the groundstaff hurries to get the covers back on. It doesn't look that heavy but seems to be steady.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.6", "Id": "28", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5244", "Batsman": "10129", "Commentary": "Short ball on off, Root punches the ball off the back foot.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.5", "Id": "27", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5244", "Batsman": "33031", "Commentary": "The batsman plays it with an angled bat and guides it to third man. One run added to the total.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "26", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Oh dear... the drizzle is getting heavier. The umbrellas are starting to open up in the stands...", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.4", "Id": "25", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5244", "Batsman": "10129", "Commentary": "Length ball on middle and leg, Root nudges it to square leg for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.3", "Id": "24", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5244", "Batsman": "10129", "Commentary": "Defended off the back foot by the batsman.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.2", "Id": "23", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5244", "Batsman": "10129", "Commentary": "Short ball outside off, Roy square cuts it to third man for a couple.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.1", "Id": "22", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5244", "Batsman": "33031", "Commentary": "The batsman works it down the leg side. The batsmen have run through for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.6", "Id": "21", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "10129", "Commentary": "Length ball outside off, defended to the point region.", "Summary": {"Score": "11/1", "Over": "3", "Runs": "7", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "10129", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "8", "Balls": "12", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "33031", "Runs": "3", "Balls": "5", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "5388", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "8", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.5", "Id": "20", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "10129", "Commentary": "Length ball on off, pushed to mid on.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.4", "Id": "19", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "10129", "Commentary": "The batsman defends it from within the crease.", "Milestone": null, "