e big opening stand in the second ODI.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "22878", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.2", "Id": "3", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "33031", "Commentary": "Short ball outside off, Roy mistimes his cut to the off side for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.1", "Id": "2", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "33031", "Commentary": "Short ball on the stumps, blocked off the back foot back to the bowler.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "1", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Welcome back to the run chase. The rain has subsided and we are ready to resume. It is still overcast though and more rain is forecast on its way. SL will hope that the rain would have spiced up the pitch a bit. Out come the players to the middle. JASON ROY and ALEX HALES are the openers and SURANGA LAKMAL starts off the bowling proceedings.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}], "Deleted_UID": null}, "meta": {"app_status_code": 1, "message": "Success", "pagination": true, "count": 32, "timestamp": {"utc_time": "6/20/2026 7:13:03 AM"}}}